+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+The tool registry validates model-supplied input against the tool's declared JSON Schema before execution.
+
+- Missing required properties yield a descriptive tool result without invoking the executor; valid input including extra properties reaches it unchanged. ([validated by: rejects missing required input before invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4))
+- Wrong types and enum values yield descriptive tool results without including input values or invoking the executor. ([validated by: rejects wrong types and enum values without exposing input values](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L27))
+- An uncompilable static schema fails during registration with the tool name. ([validated by: rejects an uncompilable static schema at registration with the tool name](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L55))
+- A function-valued definition is validated against its current resolved schema on each call. ([validated by: validates each dynamic definition against its current schema](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L65))
